#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:4
msgid "v4.4.0"
msgstr "v4.4.0"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.4.0 is a major modernization release that rebases OpenMV IDE from its "
"long-standing Qt Creator 10.0.1 base onto Qt Creator 14.0.2, reapplying the "
"full OpenMV plugin and every fork customization on top of the newer base. On"
" top of that, this release bundles an embedded Python language server for "
"offline code completion, enables GitHub Copilot on every platform, "
"introduces a new custom OpenMV DFU bootloader, and migrates OpenMV cameras "
"to a new ``37C5`` USB vendor ID. The base change is a large internal "
"modernization but does not break user projects; see *Breaking changes* for "
"the small number of user-visible workflow changes."
msgstr ""
"v4.4.0 是一次重大的现代化版本，它将 OpenMV IDE 从长期使用的 Qt Creator 10.0.1 基础迁移到 Qt Creator "
"14.0.2，并在更新的基础之上重新应用了完整的 OpenMV 插件以及所有 fork 定制项。在此之上，本次版本还内置了一个嵌入式 Python "
"语言服务器以支持离线代码补全，在所有平台上启用了 GitHub Copilot，引入了全新的自定义 OpenMV DFU 引导加载程序，并将 "
"OpenMV 摄像头迁移到新的 ``37C5`` USB 供应商 "
"ID。基础版本的变更是一次大规模的内部现代化改造，但不会破坏用户项目；少数用户可见的工作流变更请参见 *Breaking changes*\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:19
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:22
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Qt Creator 14.0.2 rebase.** The IDE moves from Qt Creator 10.0.1 to "
"14.0.2, with the entire OpenMV plugin and all ``// OPENMV-DIFF //`` "
"customizations reapplied on the modern base (`d6c895be8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d6c895be8>`__, `1fa75b397 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1fa75b397>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Qt Creator 14.0.2 重置基础。** IDE 从 Qt Creator 10.0.1 迁移到 14.0.2，整个 OpenMV "
"插件以及所有 ``// OPENMV-DIFF //`` 定制项均在现代化的基础之上重新应用（\\ `d6c895be8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d6c895be8>`__\\ 、\\ `1fa75b397 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1fa75b397>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Embedded Python language server.** The IDE now ships and auto-uses a "
"bundled ``pylsp`` (with astroid 3.3.5), giving offline Python/MicroPython "
"code completion without a separate pip install on Windows, macOS, and Linux "
"x86_64 (`257addee0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/257addee0>`__, `5a2b3e72f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5a2b3e72f>`__, `94470798d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/94470798d>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**嵌入式 Python 语言服务器。** IDE 现已自带并自动使用内置的 ``pylsp``\\ （搭配 astroid 3.3.5），无需在 "
"Windows、macOS 和 Linux x86_64 上单独执行 pip 安装即可获得离线 Python/MicroPython 代码补全（\\ "
"`257addee0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/257addee0>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`5a2b3e72f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5a2b3e72f>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`94470798d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/94470798d>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:35
msgid ""
"**GitHub Copilot on all platforms.** Copilot is integrated and enabled by "
"default, with a bundled Node.js 20.18.0 runtime for Windows, macOS, and "
"Linux so it is no longer limited to selected machines, plus a startup dialog"
" to turn it on (`bb07d582b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/bb07d582b>`__, `1cb967c5a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/1cb967c5a>`__, `b37e48040 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b37e48040>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**所有平台上的 GitHub Copilot。** Copilot 已集成并默认启用，并为 Windows、macOS 和 Linux 内置了 "
"Node.js 20.18.0 运行时，因此不再局限于特定机器，同时还提供了一个用于开启它的启动对话框（\\ `bb07d582b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/bb07d582b>`__\\ 、\\ `1cb967c5a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1cb967c5a>`__\\ 、\\ `b37e48040 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b37e48040>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:42
msgid ""
"**New OpenMV DFU bootloader.** A fully-implemented custom ``openmv_dfu`` "
"bootloader flow drives firmware updates from ``settings.json``, including a "
"\"board in DFU mode detected\" dialog offering install-latest-release, load-"
"specific-firmware, and erase-filesystem choices, plus a fallback-bootloader "
"path for recovering bricked cameras (`08b9d0676 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/08b9d0676>`__, `6a6a9351d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6a6a9351d>`__, `6d78d6571 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**全新的 OpenMV DFU 引导加载程序。** 一套完整实现的自定义 ``openmv_dfu`` 引导加载流程从 "
"``settings.json`` 驱动固件更新，其中包括一个\"检测到处于 DFU "
"模式的开发板\"对话框，提供安装最新发行版、加载特定固件和擦除文件系统等选项，并提供一条用于恢复变砖摄像头的回退引导加载程序路径（\\ "
"`08b9d0676 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/08b9d0676>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`6a6a9351d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6a6a9351d>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`6d78d6571 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:50
msgid ""
"**New camera support.** Adds the OpenMV Cam N6, RT1062, and AE3 boards, and "
"migrates cameras to the new ``37C5`` USB vendor ID with updated DFU drivers "
"and udev rules (`000ed8a87 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/000ed8a87>`__, `f453bc945 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f453bc945>`__, `4a16e04c2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4a16e04c2>`__, `6d78d6571 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**新摄像头支持。** 新增对 OpenMV Cam N6、RT1062 和 AE3 开发板的支持，并将摄像头迁移到新的 ``37C5`` USB "
"供应商 ID，同时更新了 DFU 驱动和 udev 规则（\\ `000ed8a87 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/000ed8a87>`__\\ 、\\ `f453bc945 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f453bc945>`__\\ 、\\ `4a16e04c2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4a16e04c2>`__\\ 、\\ `6d78d6571 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:57
msgid ""
"**More reliable serial.** Major serial-communication fixes resolve garbled "
"terminal text and random disconnects with TinyUSB-based cameras (`caeba6a16 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/caeba6a16>`__, `6cf122a3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6cf122a3c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**更可靠的串口通信。** 重大的串口通信修复解决了基于 TinyUSB 的摄像头出现的终端文本乱码和随机断连问题（\\ `caeba6a16 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/caeba6a16>`__\\ 、\\ `6cf122a3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6cf122a3c>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:63
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:65
msgid ""
"**OpenMV DFU bootloader.** A new ``openmv_dfu`` bootloader system with "
"dedicated DFU drivers and a fallback-bootloader mechanism recovers bricked "
"cameras across firmware types (`6a6a9351d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6a6a9351d>`__, `6d78d6571 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__). The flow drives firmware updates from "
"``settings.json`` and presents a \"board in DFU mode detected\" dialog with "
"install-latest-release, load-specific-firmware, and erase-filesystem options"
" (`08b9d0676 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/08b9d0676>`__, "
"`ef19133b6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ef19133b6>`__, "
"`9c59d113c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9c59d113c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV DFU 引导加载程序。** 全新的 ``openmv_dfu`` 引导加载系统配备专用的 DFU "
"驱动和回退引导加载机制，可在各类固件之间恢复变砖的摄像头（\\ `6a6a9351d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6a6a9351d>`__\\ 、\\ `6d78d6571 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__\\ ）。该流程从 ``settings.json`` 驱动固件更新，并呈现一个\"检测到处于 "
"DFU 模式的开发板\"对话框，提供安装最新发行版、加载特定固件和擦除文件系统等选项（\\ `08b9d0676 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/08b9d0676>`__\\ 、\\ `ef19133b6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ef19133b6>`__\\ 、\\ `9c59d113c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9c59d113c>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:76
msgid ""
"**Board name in port picker.** The serial-port selection dialog now probes "
"each port and shows the detected board name next to the port (e.g. ``COM3: "
"OpenMV Cam H7``) instead of a bare port name (`9837d6cb5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9837d6cb5>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**端口选择器中显示开发板名称。** 串口选择对话框现在会探测每个端口，并在端口旁显示检测到的开发板名称（例如 ``COM3: OpenMV Cam "
"H7``\\ ），而不再只是一个裸的端口名称（\\ `9837d6cb5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9837d6cb5>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:80
msgid ""
"**Tabbed editor.** The tabbed-editor plugin is restored, adding a row of "
"document tabs above the editor area for switching between open files "
"(`c8519c09f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c8519c09f>`__), and"
" it now persists and restores tab ordering across sessions (`55ccfb207 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/55ccfb207>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**标签式编辑器。** 恢复了标签式编辑器插件，在编辑区上方添加了一行文档标签，用于在打开的文件之间切换（\\ `c8519c09f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c8519c09f>`__\\ "
"），并且现在可以跨会话保存和恢复标签顺序（\\ `55ccfb207 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/55ccfb207>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:85
msgid ""
"**Python syntax highlighting.** Adds a dedicated Python syntax-highlighting "
"definition for the editor with string-format, float, and keyword rules "
"(`9be46c0c3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9be46c0c3>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Python 语法高亮。** 为编辑器新增了专门的 Python 语法高亮定义，包含字符串格式化、浮点数和关键字规则（\\ `9be46c0c3 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9be46c0c3>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:90
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他变更与改进"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Firmware-loading refactor.** Firmware-loading code was split into separate"
" per-type bootloader handlers (OpenMV DFU, Arduino DFU, BOSSAC, i.MX, "
"picotool), adding touch-to-reset PID handling for Arduino DFU boards and "
"explicit \"Legacy\" board variants for alternate VID/PID devices (`9f465f9f8"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9f465f9f8>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**固件加载重构。** 固件加载代码被拆分为各类型独立的引导加载处理器（OpenMV DFU、Arduino "
"DFU、BOSSAC、i.MX、picotool），为 Arduino DFU 开发板添加了 touch-to-reset PID 处理，并为采用替代 "
"VID/PID 的设备添加了显式的\"Legacy\"开发板变体（\\ `9f465f9f8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9f465f9f8>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:97
msgid ""
"**STM32 ROM-bootloader safeguards.** The IDE now warns or blocks loading "
"``firmware.dfu``/``openmv.dfu`` onto the STM32 ROM recovery bootloader, "
"recommending only ``bootloader.dfu`` to avoid bricking STM32H7 boards "
"affected by a chip ROM bootloader bug (`c5ce0ae1a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c5ce0ae1a>`__, `e7cde1ec1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e7cde1ec1>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**STM32 ROM 引导加载程序防护。** IDE 现在会在将 ``firmware.dfu``/``openmv.dfu`` 加载到 STM32 "
"ROM 恢复引导加载程序时发出警告或加以阻止，并建议仅使用 ``bootloader.dfu``\\ ，以避免因芯片 ROM 引导加载程序的缺陷而使 "
"STM32H7 开发板变砖（\\ `c5ce0ae1a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c5ce0ae1a>`__\\ 、\\ `e7cde1ec1 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e7cde1ec1>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:103
msgid ""
"**Automatic, silent Python LSP setup.** The Python language server now "
"installs and updates automatically without infobar prompts or console "
"message spam (`d89f5985f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d89f5985f>`__), and the Python autocomplete/documentation "
"hover system was reworked into a dedicated OpenMV doc engine that parses the"
" bundled HTML library docs to drive keyword highlighting and tooltips "
"(`47e02873b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/47e02873b>`__, "
"`4f9853f21 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4f9853f21>`__, "
"`82cefc931 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/82cefc931>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**自动、静默的 Python LSP 设置。** Python 语言服务器现在会自动安装和更新，不再弹出信息栏提示或刷屏控制台消息（\\ "
"`d89f5985f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d89f5985f>`__\\ ），并且"
" Python 自动补全/文档悬停系统被重构为一个专用的 OpenMV 文档引擎，它解析内置的 HTML 库文档来驱动关键字高亮和工具提示（\\ "
"`47e02873b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/47e02873b>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`4f9853f21 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4f9853f21>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`82cefc931 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/82cefc931>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:113
msgid ""
"**Linux Python interpreter detection.** Interpreter detection on Linux is "
"now automatic, considering only Python 3 interpreters from ``PATH`` and "
"selecting the newest as the single default (`214fdc758 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/214fdc758>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Linux Python 解释器检测。** Linux 上的解释器检测现在是自动的，仅考虑来自 ``PATH`` 的 Python 3 "
"解释器，并选择最新版本作为唯一默认项（\\ `214fdc758 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/214fdc758>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:117
msgid ""
"**Python settings cleanup.** The per-interpreter management group and "
"Interpreters page are hidden, the Language Server Configuration is filed "
"under a ``Python`` category, and the unused REPL and interpreter-selector "
"toolbar buttons are hidden in the Python editor (`d89f5985f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d89f5985f>`__). On Windows, the"
" IDE now auto-registers the bundled embedded ``python.exe`` as the default "
"interpreter, with the bundled language server treated as already installed "
"(`1d9ca003e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1d9ca003e>`__, "
"`d89f5985f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d89f5985f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Python 设置清理。** 隐藏了按解释器管理的分组和 Interpreters 页面，Language Server Configuration"
" 被归入 ``Python`` 类别下，并在 Python 编辑器中隐藏了未使用的 REPL 和解释器选择器工具栏按钮（\\ `d89f5985f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d89f5985f>`__\\ ）。在 Windows "
"上，IDE 现在会自动将内置的嵌入式 ``python.exe`` 注册为默认解释器，并将内置语言服务器视为已安装（\\ `1d9ca003e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1d9ca003e>`__\\ 、\\ `d89f5985f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d89f5985f>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:127
msgid ""
"**Cleaner profile directory.** The IDE no longer writes unused Qt Creator "
"settings files (devices, kits, toolchains, Qt versions) and opens files "
"directly in the editor (`3771b0107 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3771b0107>`__), no longer scans the system for qmake/Qt "
"versions (`42807f25f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/42807f25f>`__), and avoids loading unused "
"device/toolchain/kit machinery and startup noise (`902a357de "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/902a357de>`__, `b2666a35b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b2666a35b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**更整洁的配置目录。** IDE 不再写入未使用的 Qt Creator 设置文件（设备、套件、工具链、Qt 版本），而是直接在编辑器中打开文件（\\"
" `3771b0107 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3771b0107>`__\\ "
"），不再扫描系统中的 qmake/Qt 版本（\\ `42807f25f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/42807f25f>`__\\ ），并避免加载未使用的设备/工具链/套件相关机制以及启动时的杂项（\\ "
"`902a357de <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/902a357de>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`b2666a35b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b2666a35b>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:136
msgid ""
"**Safer updates.** Updating the IDE no longer clobbers user resources; only "
"the managed resource folders (examples, firmware, html, models) are removed "
"and recopied, with ``micropython-headers`` additionally removed (it is "
"installed separately rather than recopied via this path), and a clearer "
"error if ``firmware/settings.json`` is missing or invalid (`b4b8c208d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b4b8c208d>`__, `3255ba4fb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3255ba4fb>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**更安全的更新。** 更新 IDE "
"不再覆盖用户资源；只有受管理的资源文件夹（examples、firmware、html、models）会被删除并重新复制，此外 "
"``micropython-headers`` 也会被删除（它会单独安装，而不是通过此路径重新复制），并且在 "
"``firmware/settings.json`` 缺失或无效时会给出更清晰的错误提示（\\ `b4b8c208d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b4b8c208d>`__\\ 、\\ `3255ba4fb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3255ba4fb>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:143
msgid ""
"**Faster DFU connect.** The DFU connection wait time was reduced so flashing"
" and connecting are faster (`11d8c9fe3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/11d8c9fe3>`__, `4700bf678 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4700bf678>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**更快的 DFU 连接。** DFU 连接的等待时间已缩短，使刷写和连接更快（\\ `11d8c9fe3 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/11d8c9fe3>`__\\ 、\\ `4700bf678 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4700bf678>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:147
msgid ""
"**Restored OpenMV menu and UI customizations.** The streamlined OpenMV menu "
"layout is reapplied, hiding the Build and Debug menus and removing project-"
"management actions (`7503f2bec <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/7503f2bec>`__); the code-completion engine regains "
"class/method awareness and public/private keyword scopes for MicroPython "
"autocomplete (`55fc348ea <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/55fc348ea>`__); terminal ANSI color rendering is reapplied "
"with theme-aware bright/dim values and cursor-back escape support "
"(`c6787a27a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c6787a27a>`__); and"
" the image viewer toolbar is customized with resolution/zoom tooltips and a "
"relocated Fit-to-Screen action (`734fec693 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/734fec693>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**恢复 OpenMV 菜单和 UI 定制项。** 重新应用了精简后的 OpenMV 菜单布局，隐藏了 Build 和 Debug "
"菜单并移除了项目管理操作（\\ `7503f2bec <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/7503f2bec>`__\\ ）；代码补全引擎重新具备了类/方法感知能力以及用于 MicroPython 自动补全的 "
"public/private 关键字作用域（\\ `55fc348ea <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/55fc348ea>`__\\ ）；终端 ANSI "
"颜色渲染被重新应用，带有主题感知的亮/暗值以及对光标后退转义序列的支持（\\ `c6787a27a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c6787a27a>`__\\ "
"）；图像查看器工具栏经过定制，加入了分辨率/缩放工具提示，并重新放置了 Fit-to-Screen 操作（\\ `734fec693 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/734fec693>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:160
msgid ""
"**Restored bundled resources.** Flashing tools, DFU drivers, firmware, and "
"the full example/script tree are restored into the share resources after the"
" rebase strip-down (`33c8354bc <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/33c8354bc>`__), and OpenMV's custom application startup logic"
" is reapplied: it hard-requires the ``TextEditor`` plugin (the OpenMV and "
"TabbedEditor plugin checks are present but disabled), installs a custom Qt "
"message handler, removes the ``-client``/``-pid``/``-block`` command-line "
"options, and forces single-instance behavior (`06c788f3d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/06c788f3d>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**恢复内置资源。** 在重置基础的精简之后，刷写工具、DFU 驱动、固件以及完整的示例/脚本树被恢复到共享资源中（\\ `33c8354bc "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/33c8354bc>`__\\ ），并重新应用了 OpenMV"
" 的自定义应用启动逻辑：它强制要求 ``TextEditor`` 插件（OpenMV 和 TabbedEditor "
"插件检查虽存在但被禁用），安装了自定义的 Qt 消息处理器，移除了 ``-client``/``-pid``/``-block`` "
"命令行选项，并强制单实例运行（\\ `06c788f3d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/06c788f3d>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:170
msgid ""
"**Missing-plugin failure.** The app now hard-fails with a clear error if the"
" required plugins are missing or disabled, the OpenMV plugin gained a "
"Copilot dependency, and several text-editor options (``Prefer single line "
"comments`` and the comment-position selector in Behavior settings, and "
"``Highlight selection`` in Display settings) are hidden (`1bc02b1f3 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1bc02b1f3>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**插件缺失时的失败处理。** 当所需插件缺失或被禁用时，应用现在会以清晰的错误硬性失败，OpenMV 插件新增了对 Copilot "
"的依赖，并隐藏了若干文本编辑器选项（Behavior 设置中的 ``Prefer single line comments`` 和注释位置选择器，以及 "
"Display 设置中的 ``Highlight selection``\\ ）（\\ `1bc02b1f3 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1bc02b1f3>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:176
msgid ""
"**Shorter serial timeouts.** Serial protocol timeouts were shortened (read "
"10000 to 5000 ms, write 6000 to 3000 ms) for faster failure feedback, with "
"the documented ``-override_read_timeout`` default updated to match "
"(`641385af4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/641385af4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**更短的串口超时。** 串口协议超时已缩短（读取由 10000 缩短至 5000 毫秒，写入由 6000 缩短至 3000 "
"毫秒）以更快地反馈失败，文档中记录的 ``-override_read_timeout`` 默认值也已相应更新（\\ `641385af4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/641385af4>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:180
msgid ""
"**Stuck-port recovery.** Serial ports stuck mid-command are now recovered "
"using a ``GET_STATE`` query (configurable via the get-state setting) instead"
" of a script-running query (`a8598f550 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a8598f550>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**卡死端口恢复。** 在命令执行中途卡死的串口现在使用 ``GET_STATE`` 查询（可通过 get-state "
"设置进行配置）来恢复，而不再使用脚本运行查询（\\ `a8598f550 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a8598f550>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:184
msgid ""
"**Settings dialog order.** The settings dialog hides the alphabetical "
"category sort checkbox so the page list stays in OpenMV's intended order "
"(`1cb967c5a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1cb967c5a>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**设置对话框顺序。** 设置对话框隐藏了按字母排序类别的复选框，使页面列表保持 OpenMV 设定的顺序（\\ `1cb967c5a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1cb967c5a>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:187
msgid ""
"**Copilot settings simplified.** The Copilot settings page is reduced to "
"just the sign-in/auth and proxy controls, hiding the enable-Copilot, "
"Node.js-path, dist-path, and auto-complete options (`1cb967c5a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1cb967c5a>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**简化的 Copilot 设置。** Copilot 设置页面被精简为仅保留登录/认证和代理控制项，隐藏了启用 Copilot、Node.js "
"路径、dist 路径和自动补全等选项（\\ `1cb967c5a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/1cb967c5a>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:193
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "缺陷修复"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:195
msgid ""
"Fixed major serial-communication issues by increasing the serial read stall "
"timeout 10x and disabling a ``GET_STATE``-based unstuck path that was "
"garbling serial-terminal text (`caeba6a16 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/caeba6a16>`__)."
msgstr ""
"通过将串口读取停滞超时增大 10 倍，并禁用一条会导致串口终端文本乱码的基于 ``GET_STATE`` 的解卡路径，修复了重大的串口通信问题（\\ "
"`caeba6a16 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/caeba6a16>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:199
msgid ""
"Fixed random serial disconnects with TinyUSB-based cameras by issuing a "
"frame-dump unlock command and reworking read-stall handling instead of "
"disconnecting (`6cf122a3c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6cf122a3c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"通过发出帧转储解锁命令并重做读取停滞处理（而不是断开连接），修复了基于 TinyUSB 的摄像头出现的随机串口断连问题（\\ `6cf122a3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6cf122a3c>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:203
msgid ""
"Made the camera ``get_state`` handling tolerant of short/partial replies and"
" ensured buffered serial-terminal text is flushed during error recovery so "
"log output is not lost (`c8b4248a6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c8b4248a6>`__, `247a779dd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/247a779dd>`__)."
msgstr ""
"使摄像头 ``get_state`` 处理能够容忍较短/不完整的回复，并确保在错误恢复期间刷出已缓冲的串口终端文本，从而不丢失日志输出（\\ "
"`c8b4248a6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c8b4248a6>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`247a779dd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/247a779dd>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:208
msgid ""
"Corrected DFU bootloader flash partition/alt-setting numbers for OpenMV Cam "
"firmware loading (`a8700d12d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a8700d12d>`__)."
msgstr ""
"修正了用于 OpenMV Cam 固件加载的 DFU 引导加载程序闪存分区/备用设置编号（\\ `a8700d12d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a8700d12d>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:211
msgid ""
"Restored all bootloaders by honoring a new ``hidden`` board flag, switching "
"serial-number filtering to inverse filters, and giving the Arduino Nano "
"RP2040 Connect UF2 entry a working picotool configuration (`63cee629b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/63cee629b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"通过遵循新的 ``hidden`` 开发板标志、将序列号过滤切换为反向过滤，并为 Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect 的 UF2 "
"条目提供可用的 picotool 配置，恢复了所有引导加载程序（\\ `63cee629b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/63cee629b>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:215
msgid ""
"Fixed the bootloader board-type selection dialog remembering the wrong value"
" by using separate history keys for human-readable and IMX board-type "
"selections (`a3325af32 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a3325af32>`__)."
msgstr ""
"通过为人类可读的开发板类型选择和 IMX 开发板类型选择使用各自独立的历史记录键，修复了引导加载程序开发板类型选择对话框记住错误值的问题（\\ "
"`a3325af32 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a3325af32>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:219
msgid ""
"Fixed video transcoding (Save Video) timestamp/frame-rate calculation by "
"computing the average frame interval in microseconds, supporting a new v21 "
"``ImageWriter`` time format, and guarding against null pixmaps during "
"conversion (`f5c75c749 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f5c75c749>`__, `f8f762b3e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f8f762b3e>`__)."
msgstr ""
"通过以微秒为单位计算平均帧间隔、支持新的 v21 ``ImageWriter`` 时间格式，并在转换期间防范空 pixmap，修复了视频转码（Save "
"Video）的时间戳/帧率计算问题（\\ `f5c75c749 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f5c75c749>`__\\ 、\\ `f8f762b3e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f8f762b3e>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:225
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash in the histogram/framebuffer view when an empty (null) pixmap "
"was received by guarding ``pixmapUpdate()`` against null data (`622cf5ea8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/622cf5ea8>`__)."
msgstr ""
"通过让 ``pixmapUpdate()`` 防范空数据，修复了在直方图/帧缓冲区视图收到空（null）pixmap 时发生的崩溃（\\ "
"`622cf5ea8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/622cf5ea8>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:228
msgid ""
"Restored hover annotation tooltips in the text editor so hovering over text "
"marks shows the annotation tooltip again (`1852d18e1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1852d18e1>`__)."
msgstr ""
"恢复了文本编辑器中的悬停注解工具提示，使悬停在文本标记上时再次显示注解工具提示（\\ `1852d18e1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1852d18e1>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:231
msgid ""
"Prevented the GitHub Copilot and LED-colors info dialogs from popping up "
"while the IDE is busy connecting or flashing (`f8f762b3e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f8f762b3e>`__)."
msgstr ""
"阻止 GitHub Copilot 和 LED 颜色信息对话框在 IDE 正忙于连接或刷写时弹出（\\ `f8f762b3e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f8f762b3e>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:234
msgid ""
"Added crash protection in the language client so document-content-change "
"handling no longer crashes the IDE on edge cases (`7926ffe4c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7926ffe4c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在语言客户端中添加了崩溃保护，使文档内容变更处理不再在边缘情况下使 IDE 崩溃（\\ `7926ffe4c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7926ffe4c>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:237
msgid ""
"Fixed Python language-server checks preventing a clean IDE shutdown by "
"making the Python plugin wait asynchronously for in-flight checks before "
"exiting (`9ff6c7936 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9ff6c7936>`__)."
msgstr ""
"通过让 Python 插件在退出前异步等待进行中的检查，修复了 Python 语言服务器检查阻碍 IDE 干净退出的问题（\\ `9ff6c7936 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9ff6c7936>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:240
msgid ""
"Fixed Python autocomplete on Linux: the language client roots itself at the "
"bundled ``micropython-headers`` and the redundant editor-toolbar completion "
"popup action is hidden (`d37f66a9a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d37f66a9a>`__, `56e748f9d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/56e748f9d>`__, `016fa73eb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/016fa73eb>`__)."
msgstr ""
"修复了 Linux 上的 Python 自动补全：语言客户端将自身根目录设为内置的 ``micropython-headers``\\ "
"，并隐藏了冗余的编辑器工具栏补全弹出操作（\\ `d37f66a9a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d37f66a9a>`__\\ 、\\ `56e748f9d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/56e748f9d>`__\\ 、\\ `016fa73eb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/016fa73eb>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:246
msgid ""
"Fixed handling of temporary/unsaved files so Save As uses the file-dialog "
"initial directory, and the Save Items dialog and Diff editor no longer show "
"internal temporary file paths (`b7f0bb378 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b7f0bb378>`__, `c8e7b6b8f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c8e7b6b8f>`__, `6b128c34c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6b128c34c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"修复了临时/未保存文件的处理，使 Save As 使用文件对话框的初始目录，并且 Save Items 对话框和 Diff "
"编辑器不再显示内部临时文件路径（\\ `b7f0bb378 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b7f0bb378>`__\\ 、\\ `c8e7b6b8f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c8e7b6b8f>`__\\ 、\\ `6b128c34c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6b128c34c>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:252
msgid ""
"Saving an untitled/temporary buffer now defaults the Save-As dialog to a "
"proper ``.py`` filename instead of an empty name (`3001fdfff "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3001fdfff>`__)."
msgstr ""
"保存未命名/临时缓冲区时，Save-As 对话框现在默认使用合适的 ``.py`` 文件名，而不再是空名称（\\ `3001fdfff "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3001fdfff>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:255
msgid ""
"Temporary/untitled documents are now offered for save when modified, "
"excluded from autosave, and routed through Save-As correctly (`f87b71cf0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f87b71cf0>`__)."
msgstr ""
"临时/未命名文档在被修改后现在会提示保存，被排除在自动保存之外，并正确地通过 Save-As 处理（\\ `f87b71cf0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f87b71cf0>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:258
msgid ""
"Fixed Recent Files menu ordering so re-opening an already-listed file no "
"longer reorders it, and the file dialog now defaults to the projects "
"directory (`d49c0c993 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d49c0c993>`__)."
msgstr ""
"修复了 Recent Files 菜单的排序，使重新打开一个已列出的文件不再改变其顺序，并且文件对话框现在默认指向 projects 目录（\\ "
"`d49c0c993 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d49c0c993>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:262
msgid ""
"Fixed message-box text rendering by no longer forcing rich-text format on "
"checkable message boxes, so raw text displays correctly (`0c565502f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0c565502f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"通过不再对可勾选的消息框强制使用富文本格式，修复了消息框文本渲染问题，使原始文本能够正确显示（\\ `0c565502f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0c565502f>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:265
msgid ""
"Fixed tooltip colors so tooltips render correctly in the light theme "
"(`35cbf077b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/35cbf077b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"修复了工具提示颜色，使工具提示在浅色主题下正确渲染（\\ `35cbf077b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/35cbf077b>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:267
msgid ""
"General Qt Creator stability and cleanup fixes across core settings, the "
"language client, MSVC toolchain, project explorer, and Python plugins "
"(`836b163dc <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/836b163dc>`__, "
"`134f43cb8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/134f43cb8>`__)."
msgstr ""
"针对核心设置、语言客户端、MSVC 工具链、项目浏览器和 Python 插件的通用 Qt Creator 稳定性和清理修复（\\ `836b163dc "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/836b163dc>`__\\ 、\\ `134f43cb8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/134f43cb8>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:271
msgid ""
"Corrected the Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense bundled firmware folder name "
"(`b1d8ac227 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b1d8ac227>`__) and "
"fixed the Linux udev rule for the AE3 DFU bootloader product ID, correcting "
"``96E3`` to lowercase ``96e3`` so udev's case-sensitive ``idProduct`` match "
"works (`2cd43c96b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2cd43c96b>`__). The AE3 DFU bootloader Linux udev rule was "
"also updated to the ``37c5:afe3`` product ID for the ``openmvdfu`` symlink "
"(`b99555637 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b99555637>`__)."
msgstr ""
"修正了 Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense 内置固件文件夹的名称（\\ `b1d8ac227 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b1d8ac227>`__\\ ），并修复了 AE3 DFU "
"引导加载程序产品 ID 的 Linux udev 规则，将 ``96E3`` 更正为小写的 ``96e3``\\ ，使 udev 区分大小写的 "
"``idProduct`` 匹配正常工作（\\ `2cd43c96b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2cd43c96b>`__\\ ）。AE3 DFU 引导加载程序的 Linux udev 规则也已更新为 "
"``openmvdfu`` 符号链接使用的 ``37c5:afe3`` 产品 ID（\\ `b99555637 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b99555637>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:282
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "平台与工具支持"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:284
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 14.0.2 (rebased from 10.0.1)."
msgstr "**Qt Creator 基础版本：** 14.0.2（从 10.0.1 重置基础而来）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:285
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Cam N6** is now supported (VID:PID 37C5:1206, DFU bootloader "
"37C5:9206), including firmware settings, a Windows DFU driver, and a Linux "
"udev rule (`000ed8a87 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/000ed8a87>`__, `1b950c8c6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/1b950c8c6>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Cam N6** 现已受支持（VID:PID 37C5:1206，DFU 引导加载程序 "
"37C5:9206），包括固件设置、Windows DFU 驱动和 Linux udev 规则（\\ `000ed8a87 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/000ed8a87>`__\\ 、\\ `1b950c8c6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1b950c8c6>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:290
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Cam RT1062** is now supported under a new custom USB VID/PID "
"(37C5:1060), including DFU drivers, udev rules, and retained legacy "
"1209:ABD1 entries for older units (`f453bc945 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f453bc945>`__, `d55d6441f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d55d6441f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Cam RT1062** 现已在新的自定义 USB VID/PID（37C5:1060）下受支持，包括 DFU 驱动、udev "
"规则，并为旧设备保留了 1209:ABD1 的旧版条目（\\ `f453bc945 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f453bc945>`__\\ 、\\ `d55d6441f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d55d6441f>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:295
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Cam AE3** is now supported, including Windows DFU drivers, its "
"firmware/config image tree, and USB VID/PID (updated to 37C5:16E3 runtime / "
"37C5:96E3 bootloader) (`4a16e04c2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4a16e04c2>`__, `cc52e76f5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/cc52e76f5>`__, `3f75e7de4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3f75e7de4>`__, `8eb80b129 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/8eb80b129>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Cam AE3** 现已受支持，包括 Windows DFU 驱动、其固件/配置镜像树，以及 USB VID/PID（已更新为运行时 "
"37C5:16E3 / 引导加载程序 37C5:96E3）（\\ `4a16e04c2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4a16e04c2>`__\\ 、\\ `cc52e76f5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/cc52e76f5>`__\\ 、\\ `3f75e7de4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3f75e7de4>`__\\ 、\\ `8eb80b129 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/8eb80b129>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:302
msgid ""
"**New USB VID/PID system:** OpenMV cameras move to vendor ID ``37C5`` with "
"new bootloader/DFU IDs (e.g. 37C5:1202/9202 M4, 1203/9203 M7, 1204/9204 H7, "
"124A/924A H7 Plus, 1205/9205), relabeling old 1209:ABD1 boards as Legacy "
"while still supporting both old and new firmware (`6d78d6571 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__, `6a6a9351d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6a6a9351d>`__, `500b1a0bf "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/500b1a0bf>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**全新的 USB VID/PID 体系：** OpenMV 摄像头迁移到供应商 ID ``37C5``\\ ，并采用新的引导加载程序/DFU "
"ID（例如 37C5:1202/9202 M4、1203/9203 M7、1204/9204 H7、124A/924A H7 "
"Plus、1205/9205），将旧的 1209:ABD1 开发板重新标记为 Legacy，同时仍然支持新旧两种固件（\\ `6d78d6571 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__\\ 、\\ `6a6a9351d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6a6a9351d>`__\\ 、\\ `500b1a0bf "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/500b1a0bf>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:309
msgid ""
"**PAG7936** image sensor added to the recognized sensor list (`f9e3f3461 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f9e3f3461>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**PAG7936** 图像传感器已添加到可识别的传感器列表中（\\ `f9e3f3461 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f9e3f3461>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:311
msgid ""
"**Embedded Python 3.13** interpreter bundled for macOS, Linux x86_64, Linux "
"arm64, and Linux arm (`9133b1516 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9133b1516>`__), with native ``libpython3.13`` and ``ujson`` "
"shared libraries (`d3aa663d8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d3aa663d8>`__, `a2cb24e74 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a2cb24e74>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**嵌入式 Python 3.13** 解释器已为 macOS、Linux x86_64、Linux arm64 和 Linux arm 内置（\\ "
"`9133b1516 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9133b1516>`__\\ "
"），并附带原生的 ``libpython3.13`` 和 ``ujson`` 共享库（\\ `d3aa663d8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d3aa663d8>`__\\ 、\\ `a2cb24e74 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a2cb24e74>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:317
msgid ""
"**Bundled language server:** ``pylsp`` with astroid 3.3.5 on Windows, macOS,"
" and Linux x86_64 (`257addee0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/257addee0>`__). The Windows build ships an embedded CPython "
"with python-lsp-server 1.12.0, jedi 0.17.2, docstring_to_markdown 0.15, pip "
"24.2, and distlib 0.3.9 (`9b6434602 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9b6434602>`__, `069807cd3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/069807cd3>`__, `5f2e45196 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5f2e45196>`__, `3b6c6c312 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3b6c6c312>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**内置语言服务器：** 在 Windows、macOS 和 Linux x86_64 上提供搭配 astroid 3.3.5 的 "
"``pylsp``\\ （\\ `257addee0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/257addee0>`__\\ ）。Windows 构建附带一个嵌入式 CPython，内含 python-lsp-"
"server 1.12.0、jedi 0.17.2、docstring_to_markdown 0.15、pip 24.2 和 distlib "
"0.3.9（\\ `9b6434602 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9b6434602>`__\\ 、\\ `069807cd3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/069807cd3>`__\\ 、\\ `5f2e45196 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5f2e45196>`__\\ 、\\ `3b6c6c312 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3b6c6c312>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:326
msgid ""
"**Bundled Node.js 20.18.0** \"Iron\" LTS runtime for Windows, macOS, Linux "
"arm64, Linux x64, and Linux armv7 to enable GitHub Copilot on all platforms "
"(`bb07d582b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/bb07d582b>`__, "
"`6db78bf45 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6db78bf45>`__, "
"`1cb967c5a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1cb967c5a>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**内置 Node.js 20.18.0** \"Iron\" LTS 运行时，面向 Windows、macOS、Linux arm64、Linux "
"x64 和 Linux armv7，以在所有平台上启用 GitHub Copilot（\\ `bb07d582b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/bb07d582b>`__\\ 、\\ `6db78bf45 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6db78bf45>`__\\ 、\\ `1cb967c5a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1cb967c5a>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:331
msgid ""
"**Alif Security Toolkit** signed boot/system-package binaries and user guide"
" bundled for Windows, macOS, and Linux x86_64 for provisioning Alif-based "
"OpenMV cameras (e.g. AE3) (`f63851be3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f63851be3>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Alif Security Toolkit** 经签名的 boot/system-package 二进制文件和用户指南已为 "
"Windows、macOS 和 Linux x86_64 内置，用于配置基于 Alif 的 OpenMV 摄像头（例如 AE3）（\\ "
"`f63851be3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f63851be3>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:335
msgid ""
"**Linux desktop integration** is restored, installing an application desktop"
" entry and AppStream metadata and registering the Python (``.py``) MIME type"
" (`3fa25f571 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3fa25f571>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Linux 桌面集成** 已恢复，会安装应用程序桌面条目和 AppStream 元数据，并注册 Python（\\ ``.py``\\ ）MIME "
"类型（\\ `3fa25f571 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3fa25f571>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:340
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "破坏性变更"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:342
msgid ""
"No scripting API changed. The following user-visible workflow and behavior "
"changes may be noticed:"
msgstr "脚本 API 没有任何变化。以下用户可见的工作流和行为变更可能会被注意到："

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:345
msgid ""
"**New USB vendor ID.** OpenMV cameras migrate to vendor ID ``37C5`` with new"
" product and DFU bootloader IDs; boards on the old ``1209:ABD1`` VID are now"
" labeled \"Legacy\". The IDE supports both old and new firmware "
"simultaneously, but Linux users must reinstall the updated udev rules for "
"the new IDs to be recognized."
msgstr ""
"**新的 USB 供应商 ID。** OpenMV 摄像头迁移到供应商 ID ``37C5``\\ ，并采用新的产品和 DFU 引导加载程序 "
"ID；使用旧的 ``1209:ABD1`` VID 的开发板现在被标记为\"Legacy\"。IDE 同时支持新旧两种固件，但 Linux "
"用户必须重新安装更新后的 udev 规则，新的 ID 才能被识别。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:350
msgid ""
"**Legacy board entries hidden.** Legacy variants of the OpenMV Cam "
"M4/M7/H7/H7 Plus/Pure Thermal boards are now suppressed from the "
"firmware/board selection list via a new ``legacy`` board flag (distinct from"
" the pre-existing ``hidden`` flag), so users who specifically need a legacy "
"board entry will no longer see it in the dropdown (`6d78d6571 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**旧版开发板条目被隐藏。** OpenMV Cam M4/M7/H7/H7 Plus/Pure Thermal 开发板的旧版变体现在会通过一个新的 "
"``legacy`` 开发板标志（不同于已有的 ``hidden`` "
"标志）从固件/开发板选择列表中被抑制，因此特别需要旧版开发板条目的用户将不再在下拉列表中看到它（\\ `6d78d6571 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:356
msgid ""
"**Shorter serial timeouts.** The default response read timeout drops from "
"10000 ms to 5000 ms and the write timeout from 6000 ms to 3000 ms (the "
"``-override_read_timeout`` default is now documented as 5000). Slow "
"boards/links that relied on the longer defaults may time out sooner."
msgstr ""
"**更短的串口超时。** 默认响应读取超时从 10000 毫秒降至 5000 毫秒，写入超时从 6000 毫秒降至 3000 毫秒（\\ "
"``-override_read_timeout`` 默认值现记录为 5000）。依赖较长默认值的慢速开发板/链路可能会更早超时。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:361
msgid ""
"The Qt Creator 14.0.2 rebase is a large internal modernization but is not "
"breaking for user projects."
msgstr "Qt Creator 14.0.2 的重置基础是一次大规模的内部现代化改造，但不会破坏用户项目。"
